Z||000008||Fiero5||06-18-2001||10:23 AM||||Well, I found it. Congrats to everyone who won, and also to those who came but didn't win. <BR>I have now received a few e-mails asking what I thought of the voting/winners list. Kind of strange question wondering what my opinion is on the winners, since they are voted on by the other Fiero owners at the show. Has anyone else been asked what they thought?<BR>I am still kinda lost at the questions I guess.<P>I guess my only question at this point is why the 85 class got cut down from two to one, and then the one that didn't have it's lids up won over one that was on full display. Granted it was my sons car that is in question, but that is a moot point and I would be asking even if it wasn't.<P>I don't want to sound like I am upset over anyone not winning, it's just that some are saying certain things that are adding to my own curiosity now.<P>Steve||||reg||1
